---
// Quiz figure for Post 6: Balance sheet cash+deposits vs financial debt comparison.
---
<div class="qfig-sbq06bs">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 185" role="img" aria-label="Balance sheet excerpt showing Cash 80B, Short-term bank term deposits 240B, Short-term debt 90B, Long-term debt 30B, and Trade receivables 180B.">
    <text x="16" y="24" class="qfig-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>VAS Balance Sheet Excerpt (billion VND)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Trích Bảng cân đối kế toán VAS (tỷ đồng)</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="16" y="44" width="262" height="124" rx="8" class="qfig-card" />
    <text x="32" y="70" class="qfig-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Assets (Tài sản)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Bên Tài sản</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="96">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Cash &amp; equiv: 80B</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Tiền &amp; tương đương tiền: 80 tỷ</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="122">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Term bank deposits: 240B</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Tiền gửi kỳ hạn: 240 tỷ</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="32" y="148" class="qfig-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Trade receivables: 180B</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Phải thu khách hàng: 180 tỷ</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="302" y="44" width="262" height="124" rx="8" class="qfig-card-red" />
    <text x="318" y="70" class="qfig-t qfig-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Debt &amp; Equity (Nguồn vốn)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Bên Nguồn vốn</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="96">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Short-term loans: 90B</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Vay ngắn hạn: 90 tỷ</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="122">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Long-term loans: 30B</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Vay dài hạn: 30 tỷ</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="318" y="148" class="qfig-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Shareholders' equity: 650B</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Vốn chủ sở hữu: 650 tỷ</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-sbq06bs { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-sbq06bs svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-sbq06bs text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-sbq06bs .qfig-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq06bs .qfig-t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq06bs .qfig-m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-sbq06bs .qfig-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .qfig-sbq06bs .qfig-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-sbq06bs .qfig-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
</style>
